{"id":"0869da29c285cc44","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Incompleteness under explicit derivability conditions","display":"lem-second-incompleteness — Incompleteness under explicit derivability conditions","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-second-incompleteness","aliases":["72-lem-second-incompleteness"],"display":"lem-second-incompleteness — Incompleteness under explicit derivability conditions","depends_on":["[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]"],"source_kind":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency","verification_status":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-second-incompleteness — Incompleteness under explicit derivability conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件使用算术化接口的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 检查推导的每一行均为数公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\">\\(T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a>，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\)</span> 取该接口引用的算术化定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}\\)</span> 是编码接口中已经规定坏码行为的PR函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\">\\(d_\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\)</span> 为任一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\kappa)=1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\kappa)=1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ d_\\kappa⟧(n)=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}(n,n)\">\\(⟦ d_\\kappa⟧(n)=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}(n,n)\\)</span> 的程序；其PR定义方程属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意单自由变量公式B，令D(x)=B[f_d(x)/x]，令k=e(D)，并令G=D[\\bar k/x]。定义的数码代入保证e(G)=SubCode(k,k)；固定标准输入的PR计算可在PRA中验证，因此T证明G与B[\\overline{e(G)}/x]等价，得到FP。</p>\n<p>对B(x)=¬Prov(x)取不动点G。由G→¬□G，D1、D2给出□G→□¬□G；D3给出□G→□□G；命题矛盾及D1、D2遂给出□G→□⊥。所以T证明Con→¬□G→G。假若T证明Con，则T证明G，D1给出□G，而不动点给出¬□G，与元一致性矛盾。这一推导没有把理论可靠性作为前提，也没有从外部同扩张性推断D2或D3。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}$ 取 [[72-df-derivability-conditions]]，包括 $\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T$ 与 $\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$。$\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}$、$\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)$ 取该接口引用的算术化定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"d_\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\kappa)=1","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ d_\\kappa⟧(n)=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}(n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T).","display":true}],"bytes":2127,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第2章主题：[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一致性转移与不可证性分别使用 [[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]] 和 [[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]。下列编码及程序的量化均为元量化；两种编码的数码不相互混用。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-second-incompleteness|72-lem-second-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["b61898f862c734c8"]}